 and reduced to 5 cm XY cells. A cell is blocked when its local vertical span is
 at least 8 cm, retaining thin upright objects while rejecting locally planar
 floors and ramps. The full cloud is never retained or reprocessed at 20 Hz.
+Snapshot, collision evaluation, and output publication are serialized against
+perception commits, so high-rate clouds cannot starve the velocity output while
+each published decision still corresponds to one coherent input generation.
+
+The ROS OccupancyGrid value 99 denotes an already-inflated inscribed region,
+while 100 denotes a source lethal cell. The gate checks only value 100 because
+it applies the measured rectangular footprint and predicted sweep itself.
+Known lethal cells whose square overlaps the current body are treated as self
+returns. Unknown cells remain blocking even inside the current body, and fresh
+classified and raw clouds remain mandatory independent vetoes.
+
+The UGV_003 profile uses a 0.02 m/s linear deadband. This absorbs the small
+negative solver drift TEB emits during in-place turns. Larger reverse requests
+still latch the gate, and negative linear velocity is never forwarded while
+`allow_reverse` is false.
 
